  "StockRole": "Heavy Recon",
  "YangsThoughts": "I heard of this project; it was pretty bad, lot's of money changing hands and lot's of competing design requirements. It's a miracle these things ever made it to production. I will say this, the Valkyrie II is faster than the original despite being twice the weight while carrying a stronger weapons and armor compliment. It may not excel at anything in particular but it can work for most jobs it is tasked with.",
